   between Linux and Windows/Wine, including the diagnostic Zpix bytes.
9. Packaged inspector reads actual Ztext, Zpix, Zpack, Zmedia and Zero application
   headers on both hosts, with identical output and honest header-only status.
10. Packaged inspector composer reproduces tools/inspect.zero exactly on both
